description	"Captain Phasma

A hybrid melee/gunner commander with Beskar armor resistance, a spear, and rapid firing guns.

^2Weaponry:
- Heavy Melee
-- 5% faster RoF
- Quicksilver Spear (Staff Saber)
-- Saber Defense (2)
-- No Blaster Block
-- 33% thicker
- SE-44C Blaster Pistol (2)
-- 40% faster RoF
-- 15% more damage/FP damage
-- 100% slower reload
- F-11D Blaster Rifle (DC Carb 2)
-- 45% faster RoF
-- 30% less damage/FP damage
-- 20% slower mag reload
- Frag Grenades (2)
- Fire Grenade (1)

^8Attributes:
- 20% less knockback given
- 20% less knockback taken
- Strength (1)
- Stamina (2)
- Dexterity (1)
- Beskar (3)
- Blast Armor
- Armor Regen (1)
- Healing (1)
- Rally

^3Abilities:
- Sprint (2) ^3[CS1]
- Dex Roll ^3[CS2]"